msgstr "開始一場與特定怪物隊伍（monster party）之間的戰鬥測試。"

#: lutris/runners/easyrpg.py:212
msgid "AutoBattle algorithm"
msgstr "自動戰鬥算法"

#: lutris/runners/easyrpg.py:214
msgid ""
"Which AutoBattle algorithm to use.\n"
"\n"
"<b>RPG_RT</b>: The default RPG_RT compatible algorithm, including RPG_RT bugs.\n"
"<b>RPG_RT+</b>: The default RPG_RT compatible algorithm, with bug-fixes.\n"
"<b>ATTACK</b>: Like RPG_RT+ but only physical attacks, no skills."
msgstr ""
"選擇要使用的自動戰鬥算法。\n"
"\n"
"<b>RPG_RT</b>：預設的 RPG_RT 兼容算法，包含 RPG_RT 的缺陷。\n"
"<b>RPG_RT+</b>：預設的 RPG_RT 兼容算法，但修復了缺陷。\n"
"<b>ATTACK</b>：與 RPG_RT+ 類似，但僅使用物理攻擊，不釋放技能。"

