msgid "Kickstart ROMs location"
msgstr "Kickstart ROM 位置"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:232
msgid ""
"Choose the folder containing original Amiga Kickstart ROMs. Refer to FS-UAE documentation to find how to acquire them. Without these, FS-UAE uses a bundled replacement ROM which is less compatible with Amiga software."
msgstr ""
"選擇包含原始 Amiga Kickstart ROM 的檔案夾，請參閱 FS-UAE 文檔以了解如何獲取。如果未設定，FS-UAE 將使用自帶的內置 ROM，該內置 ROM 與 Amiga 軟體的相容性較差。"

