msgstr "啟用顯示濾鏡，新增掃描線來模仿以前的 CRT 顯像管顯示效果。"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:264
msgid "Graphics Card"
msgstr "顯卡"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:270
msgid ""
"Use this option to enable a graphics card. This option is none by default, in which case only chipset graphics (OCS/ECS/AGA) support is available."
msgstr "使用此選項啟用獨顯。預設情況下此選項為空，此時僅板載顯卡（OCS/ECS/AGA）可用。"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:277
msgid "Graphics Card RAM"
msgstr "顯存"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:283
msgid ""
"Override the amount of graphics memory on the graphics card. The 0 MB option is not really valid, but exists for user interface reasons."
msgstr "修改顯卡上的顯存容量。預設值 0 表示不修改顯存容量。"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:289 lutris/sysoptions.py:339
#: lutris/sysoptions.py:347 lutris/sysoptions.py:356
msgid "CPU"
msgstr "CPU"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:295
msgid ""
"Use this option to override the CPU model in the emulated Amiga. All Amiga models imply a default CPU model, so you only need to use this option if you want to use another CPU."
msgstr ""
"此選項可更改 Amiga 模擬器的 CPU 型號。模擬器中的所有 Amiga 機型都使用同一個預設 CPU 型號，使用此選項可選擇其他 CPU 型號。"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:302
msgid "Fast Memory"
msgstr "快速記憶體"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:307
msgid "Specify how much Fast Memory the Amiga model should have."
msgstr "指定 Amiga 機型擁有的快速記憶體。"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:311
msgid "Zorro III RAM"
msgstr "Zorro III 記憶體"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:317
msgid ""
"Override the amount of Zorro III Fast memory, specified in KB. Must be a multiple of 1024. The default value depends on [amiga_model]. Requires a processor with 32-bit address bus, (use for example the A1200/020 model)."
msgstr ""
"更改 Zorro III 的快速記憶體大小（以 KB 為單位，必須是 1024 的倍數），預設值取決於模擬的 Amiga 機型。需要選擇具有32位地址總線的處理器（例如 A1200/020 型號）才能使用該選項。"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:325
msgid "Floppy Drive Volume"
msgstr "軟碟機響聲音量"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:330
msgid ""
"Set volume to 0 to disable floppy drive clicks when the drive is empty. Max volume is 100."
msgstr "將音量設為 0 可禁用驅動器為空時的軟盤驅動器卡嗒聲。最大音量為 100。"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:335
msgid "Floppy Drive Speed"
msgstr "軟碟機速度"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:341
msgid ""
"Set the speed of the emulated floppy drives, in percent. For example, you can specify 800 to get an 8x increase in speed. Use 0 to specify turbo mode. Turbo mode means that all floppy operations complete immediately. The default is 100 for most models."
msgstr ""
"設定仿真軟盤驅動器的速度，以百分比為單位。例如，您可以指定 800 以使速度提高8倍。您也可以選擇 Turbo 模式，Turbo 模式意味著所有軟盤操作都將立即完成。對於大多數型號，預設值為 100。"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:349
msgid "JIT Compiler"
msgstr "啟用 JIT 即時編譯器"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:356
msgid "Feral GameMode"
msgstr "禁用遊戲性能優先模式"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:360
msgid ""
"Automatically uses Feral GameMode daemon if available. Set to true to disable the feature."
msgstr "如果遊戲性能優先模式可用，預設會自動啟用，您可以在此處禁用該功能。"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:364
msgid "CPU governor warning"
msgstr "禁用 CPU調速器警告"

#: lutris/runners/fsuae.py:369
msgid ""
"Warn if running with a CPU governor other than performance. Set to true to disable the warning."
msgstr "如果 CPU 調速器設定過頭，性能不好，則啟動時會發出警告。您可以在此處禁用警告。"

