msgid "PlayStation 4 Emulator"
msgstr "PS4模擬器"

#: lutris/runners/shadps4.py:14
msgid "Sony PlayStation 4"
msgstr "索尼 PS4（PlayStation 4）"

#: lutris/runners/shadps4.py:22
msgid "Game folder"
msgstr "遊戲檔案夾"

#: lutris/runners/shadps4.py:23
msgid "Path to the game folder (e.g., CUSA00001)"
msgstr "遊戲檔案夾的路徑（例如，CUSA00001）"

#: lutris/runners/shadps4.py:31
msgid "Emulator"
msgstr "模擬器"

#: lutris/runners/shadps4.py:33
msgid "Bundled"
msgstr "內置"

#: lutris/runners/shadps4.py:34
msgid "Launcher default"
msgstr "啟動器預設"

#: lutris/runners/shadps4.py:35
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "自定義"

#: lutris/runners/shadps4.py:42
msgid "Custom emulator path"
msgstr "自定義模擬器路徑"

#: lutris/runners/shadps4.py:43
msgid "Path to ShadPS4 SDL emulator (only used if 'Custom' is selected)"
msgstr "ShadPS4 SDL 模擬器的路徑（僅當選擇了「自定義」時使用）"

#: lutris/runners/snes9x.py:18
msgid "Super Nintendo emulator"
msgstr "超任（SFC）模擬器"

#: lutris/runners/snes9x.py:19
msgid "Snes9x"
msgstr "Snes9x"

#: lutris/runners/snes9x.py:40
msgid "Maintain aspect ratio (4:3)"
msgstr "寬高比校正"

#: lutris/runners/snes9x.py:43
msgid ""
"Super Nintendo games were made for 4:3 screens with rectangular pixels, but modern screens have square pixels, which results in a vertically squeezed image. This option corrects this by displaying rectangular pixels."
msgstr ""
"超任上的遊戲是針對具有矩形像素的 4:3 屏幕製作的，而現代屏幕則具有正方形像素，這導致了圖像的垂直壓縮。此選項透過顯示矩形像素來糾正此問題。"

#: lutris/runners/snes9x.py:53
msgid "Sound driver"
msgstr "音頻驅動"

#: lutris/runners/steam.py:30
msgid "Runs Steam for Linux games"
msgstr "運行 Linux 版 Steam 上的遊戲"

#: lutris/runners/steam.py:41
msgid ""
"The application ID can be retrieved from the game's page at steampowered.com. Example: 235320 is the app ID for <i>Original War</i> in: \n"
"http://store.steampowered.com/app/<b>235320</b>/"
msgstr ""
"可以在 Steam 官網的遊戲頁面地址中看到 Steam 應用 ID。比如：透過以下網址可以看出，<i>Original War</i> 的應用 ID 是 235320：\n"
"http://store.steampowered.com/app/<b>235320</b>/"

#: lutris/runners/steam.py:52
msgid ""
"Command line arguments used when launching the game.\n"
"Ignored when Steam Big Picture mode is enabled."
msgstr ""
"啟動遊戲時使用的命令行參數。\n"
"啟用 Steam 大屏幕模式時被忽略。"

#: lutris/runners/steam.py:57
msgid "DRM free mode (Do not launch Steam)"
msgstr "DRM free 模式（不啟動 Steam）"

#: lutris/runners/steam.py:61
msgid ""
"Run the game directly without Steam, requires the game binary path to be set"
msgstr "在不啟動 Steam 的情況下直接運行遊戲，需要設定遊戲程式路徑"

#: lutris/runners/steam.py:66
msgid "Game binary path"
msgstr "遊戲程式路徑"

#: lutris/runners/steam.py:68
msgid "Path to the game executable (Required by DRM free mode)"
msgstr "遊戲啟動程式（可執行檔案）的路徑，DRM free 模式必填"

#: lutris/runners/steam.py:74
msgid "Start Steam in Big Picture mode"
msgstr "啟動 Steam 大屏幕模式"

#: lutris/runners/steam.py:78
msgid ""
"Launches Steam in Big Picture mode.\n"
"Only works if Steam is not running or already running in Big Picture mode.\n"
"Useful when playing with a Steam Controller."
msgstr ""
"在大屏幕模式下啟動 Steam。\n"
"僅在 Steam 未運行或已在大屏幕模式下運行時才有效。\n"
"用手柄玩時很有用。"

#: lutris/runners/steam.py:89
msgid "Extra command line arguments used when launching Steam"
msgstr "啟動 Steam 時使用的額外命令行參數"

#: lutris/runners/steam.py:179
msgid "Steam for Linux installation is not handled by Lutris."
msgstr "Lutris 不負責安裝 Linux 版 Steam。"

#: lutris/runners/steam.py:181
msgid ""
"Steam for Linux installation is not handled by Lutris.\n"
"Please go to <a href='http://steampowered.com'>http://steampowered.com</a> or install Steam with the package provided by your distribution."
msgstr ""
"Lutris 不負責安裝 Linux 版 Steam。\n"
"請訪問 <a href='http://steampowered.com'>http://steampowered.com</a>，或透過您的發行版提供的軟體包安裝 Steam。"

#: lutris/runners/steam.py:195
msgid "Could not find Steam path, is Steam installed?"
msgstr "找不到 Steam 路徑，是否已安裝 Steam？"

