msgstr "虛擬桌面的大小（以像素為單位）。"

#: lutris/runners/wine.py:544 lutris/runners/wine.py:556
#: lutris/runners/wine.py:557
msgid "DPI"
msgstr "指定 DPI"

#: lutris/runners/wine.py:545
msgid "Enable DPI Scaling"
msgstr "啟用 DPI 縮放"

#: lutris/runners/wine.py:550
msgid ""
"Enables the Windows application's DPI scaling.\n"
"Otherwise, the Screen Resolution option in 'Wine configuration' controls this."
msgstr ""
"為 Windows 應用程式啟用 DPI 縮放。\n"
"如果不啟用，則 Wine 設定中的「屏幕解析度」選項將被採用。"

